  "description": "EDIT note entry rebuilds the active step chord from the entered note and held panel keys, with stock input transpose, octave latch and scale/root. Lowest retained note remains the pattern primary. Note128 clears the sidecar. No SD I/O. Stack on v1.9; hardware acceptance required. Rejects note zero, skips held zeros, validates declared staging pairs, and refuses per-step delta on multi-note or malformed sidecars; valid singletons move with their primary.",
